<title>SWEDEN: Swedish industrial production falls 1.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish industrial production falls 1.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production fell 1.3 percent in August, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
<p> (Percentage change)  AUG 96     JULY 96	 YR/YR</p>
<p>				-1.3	  -4.5	  +2.0</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
